  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rwanda CFL Energy Efficiency Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at expanding the use of high-efficiency lighting technology in Rwanda&#x2019;s residential sector through the distribution of high-quality Compact Fluorescent Lamps (CFLs) by Electricity, Water and Sanitation Authority  (EWSA), the national electricity utility. It will target units that are already connected to the grid (Component 1) as well as units that will be connected as part of the national electrification program (Component 2).</narrative>
  </description>
